window.products.push({"id":93053,"name":"Bosch Dishwasher 00165314 Durable 165314 Lower Rack Wheel PS3439123 AP2802428 Dishrack Roller Replacement SHV56C03UC SHE4AM12UC SHE43M05UC SHE43M02UC ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U+MwlQsGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 165314 Bosch Dishwasher Roller Replacement - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers 00165314, AP2802428, 00420198, 420198, 423232, AH3439123, EA3439123, PS3439123, PS8697067. 65314 Dishwasher Lower Rack Wheels by PartsBroz are compatible with Bosch, Gaggenau, Kenmore, Thermador. Bosch 165314 Lower Rack Wheels fit dozens of models and can be easily installed in a few minutes. Because of how the roller wheels break down we suggest replacing them in pairs. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Bosch Dishwasher Rack Wheels 165314? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. 00165314 Bosch Lower Rack Wheels will help if your appliance has a jammed rack. Replacing damaged or worn dishwasher wheels can help to ensure that your dishwasher operates smoothly and efficiently, making it easier to clean dishes and maintain a clean kitchen. 💡 The Bosch Lower Dishrack Wheel 00165314 is made from durable plastic and is designed to attach to the bottom of the dishwasher rack. 165314 Dishwasher Lower Rack Wheel is designed to allow the dishwasher rack to slide smoothly in and out of the machine, making it easier to load and unload dishes. 165314 Bosch Dishwasher Lower Dishrack Wheel meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are the dishwasher wheels universal? Dishwasher rack wheels are not universal and are designed to fit specific makes and models of dishwashers. It is important to ensure that you purchase the correct replacement wheels for your dishwasher to ensure a proper fit and avoid potential damage to the dishwasher rack or other parts. While some dishwasher rack wheels may look similar, they may have slight differences in size or shape that make them incompatible with certain models. 💡 Can the dishwasher wheels be bypassed? It is not recommended to bypass or remove the dishwasher wheels as they serve an important function in allowing the dishwasher racks to slide smoothly in and out of the machine. Removing or bypassing the wheels could cause damage to the dishwasher rack or other parts of the machine, and may also affect the efficiency of the dishwasher's cleaning and drying process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U+MwlQsGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YD89PNK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD89PNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD89PNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
