window.products.push({"id":93152,"name":"Overbest DA97-17376B Replacement for Samsung® HAF-QIN/EXP, HAF-QIN, DA97-08006C, RF28R7201SR, RF28R7351SG, RF23M8070SR, RF23M8090SG, OB6045, Refrigera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wYWuqSf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Overview] We started Overbest to disrupt the traditional water filtration industry with easy-to-use and affordable replacement water filters. The Overbest replacement filter for Samsung DA97-17376B is NSF 42 and NSF 372 certified and uses only premium materials that have passed rigorous in-house lab testing to provide you with higher quality drinking water. Please note the filter is a replacement for Samsung HAF-QIN, not Samsung HAF-CIN. [High-efficiency filtration] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for Samsung HAF-QIN by Overbest is NSF 42 certified to reduce chlorine by up to 97% while improving the taste of water. This is how we ensure safe and delicious water for you and your family. [Full compatibility] Our filters are precisely designed to fit your refrigerator- no annoying leaks or installation issues. [Superior materials] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for Samsung DA97-08006C is also NSF 372 certified to ensure lead-free materials. It is also BPA-free and adopts coconut shell carbon block to ensure healthy filtered water. [Economic solution] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for Samsung HAF-QIN/EXP needs to be replaced after 6 months (equivalent to 316 gallons) of use. That means fresh, clean drinking water costs an average of 8 cents a day. Overbest believes that everyone deserves a healthy life. [Month install stickers] Simply attach the correct month sticker on your replacement water filter to remind you when it needs to be replaced. [Fresh-tasting water] The natural coconut shell carbon block adopted by our water filter provides a better water taste by absorbing more impurities than cheaper mixed carbon block filters. [Strict quality standards] We carefully supervise the entire production process in the factory. Each Overbest product has undergone multiple lab tests before shipping out to provide you the superior quality water filter in the industry. [Replacement for refrigerator filter models] This Overbest refrigerator filter is a replacement for Samsung DA97-17376B, DA97-08006C, HAF-QIN, HAF-QIN/EXP, GF-841, CF-17, AQF-FF45, WS645A, FL-RF45, MB-F45, RWF4200A, PP-RWF4200A-S. [Replacement for refrigerator models] This Overbest replacement filter is compatible with Samsung RF28R7351SG, RF28R7201SG, RF23M8070SR/AA, RF23M8090SG/AA, RF23M8070SG, RF23M8070SR, RF23M8090SG, RF23M8090SR, RF23M8570SG, RF23M8570SR, RF23M8590SG, RF23M8590SR, BRF365200AP, BRF425200AP, RF23M8960S4, RF23M8960MT, RF22R7351SG, RF24R7201SG, RF23M8070SG/AA, RF23M8090SR/AA, RF23M8570SG/AA, RF23M8570SR/AA, RF23M8590SG/AA, RF23M8590SR/AA, RF23M8960S4/AA, RF23M8960MT/AA, BRF365200AP/AA, BRF425200AP/AA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wYWuqSf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Overbest","source_asin":"B09TDN6334","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TDN6334","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TDN6334","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
