window.products.push({"id":93466,"name":"Essential Values 12-Pack Toddy Filter Replacement, Coffee Filters - Reusable Coffee Filters - Replacement Coffee Filter for Toddy Cold Brew System | R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194fwu+7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL AND CONSTRUCTION: Our replacement coffee filter is made of food-grade Polypropylene, custom engineered and tested for cold brew coffee brewing. Our filter coffee diameter is 2.75 inches and it is custom fabricated to fit in place of original toddy filters. Use in mason jars, carafes, jugs, pitchers, or even a Toddy cold brew system EFFORTLESS CLEANUP AND REUSABLE: Our polyester reusable coffee filters are washable without any effort. You can simply rinse it with water, squeeze out excess, and dry it after each use. There isn’t a need to boil your tody filter to clean it, just give it a quick rinse and you are ready to reuse. Expect coffee filters to become stained after use. Replace coffee round filter every 10-12 uses or every 3 months, whichever comes sooner FILTERS OUT ALL GROUNDS AND SLUDGE: These Ultra-Fine Polypropylene coffee maker reusable filter allow for more oils and flavor to get through to your brew! This extra fine weave of our cold brew coffee maker toddy ensures only filtered coffee leaves, while coarse ground coffee and sludge stay behind. Continue to make bitter free, acid-free coffee with this washable and reusable tody cold brew filter that won't clog up PERFECTLY COMPATIBLE: Reusable pads are specially designed for ideal compatibility with Toddy Cold Brew systems. Our round coffee filters meet the filtration performance of OEM filters Toddy’s unique brand of cold brew filtration extracts all the natural and delicious flavors of coffee and tea. We took our original compatible replacement tody coffee filters for the tody cold brew coffee maker. These small round coffee filters will fit snugly into the bottom of the Toddy Cold Brew System GREAT VALUE PACK: Our 12-pack of replacement coffee filter for Toddy Cold Coffee Concentrate Brewers will keep your system stocked with filters. It’s ideal for coffee shops, offices, and heavy home users and compatible with standard and pro models. This value pack is enough for long-time use and you can easily manage fresh, tasty, and acid-free filtered coffee on different occasions just like father’s day, mother’s day, charismas, birthday party, and prom party","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194fwu+7yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Essential Values","source_asin":"B071G4ZT6Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071G4ZT6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B071G4ZT6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":93467,"name":"EveryDrop by Whirlpool Refrigerator Water Filter 2 (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OOLw7bZCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Today, even though the water that streams into our homes should be more civilized than ever, it's not. In fact, unwanted contaminants like pharmaceuticals, parasites, lead and mercury can still easily make their way into our home's water supply. EveryDrop Filters by Whirlpool Water are our advanced generation of ice & water refrigerator filters, which reduces the most contaminants - with new Triple Filtration Technology. Filter 2 reduces 24 types of contaminants, so every day it's easier to help enrich the well-being of yourself and your family with cleaner, freshly filtered water. Remember to replace your refrigerator filter every 6 months to maximize contaminant reduction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OOLw7bZCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B00UVUZRHU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UVUZRHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UVUZRHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
