window.products.push({"id":93711,"name":"COSTWAY Countertop Ice Maker, 26LBS/24H Portable Electric Ice Machine, 9 Bullet Ice / 7 Mins, Intelligent Alarm System, with Ice Scoop and Basket, for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cK3mHSoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Portable and Compact Ice Maker】-----Our ice maker has a black cuboid shape, which is compact and lightweight. So the ice machine is easy to store and carry anywhere. You can take it to enjoy barbecues, parties and other outdoor activities. It is suitable for kitchen countertop, backyards, bars, RV, boats, etc. 🧊【 Intelligent Alarm System】-----Featuring advanced infrared sensing technology, our machine will get into standby state if ice is full or water is short, which is very safe and reliable. Owing to water shortage, the standby machine will automatically restart per 20 minutes to check whether there is water or not. When ice is full, it can start itself after you remove the ice by hand. 🧊【 Safe and Durable Material】-----Our ice maker has ETL certification, so you can buy it rest your heart. Equipped with R600a refrigerant, the machine will achieve low noise level and produce safe and healthy ice cubes. Besides, our evaporator with fast cooling effect is made of copper-nickel plating, which is corrosion-resistant and durable. 🧊【 Excellent Ice-making Capacity】-----Our efficient ice maker can produce 9 chewable, delicious bullet-shaped ice-cubes in 7 minutes, without spending too much waiting time. And it can produce up to 26 pounds of ice within 24 hours, which can satisfy your daily ice requirement. 2 quarts water tank holds enough water to make ice, while ice basket can store up to 2lbs ice. 🧊【Humanized Design】-----This ice maker is designed with a high-speed DC exhaust fan, which can quickly dissipate heat for better cooling effect. And the transparent window allows you to easily view the progress and amount of ice making in the machine. In addition, it comes with an extra ice scoop and a removable ice basket, all bringing you the best ice-making experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cK3mHSoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B08JSXK7BS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JSXK7BS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JSXK7BS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
