window.products.push({"id":93776,"name":"Washing Machine Nictemaw Portable Washer 1.9 Cu.ft/17.6Lbs Capacity Full-Automatic Compact Laundry Washer With Drain Pump, 10 programs Selections with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71blCUsYLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎽【Easy to Operate & Monitor】This portable washing machine equipped with a drain pump and an extended hose to easily drain the water to the sink , Which has 10 programs and 8 water level selections with LED display, All functions and operation including water level/spin, program/delay, time set and child lock are listed clearly. Operation Steps: 1) Add water into the portable washer and dryer 2) Power On the laundry machine; 3) Select a program as you need; 4) Press Start button. 🎽【Precise Time & Water Level Control】This apartment laundry machine owns very precise time and water control function through it’s smart control panel. Under delay function, the digital timer shows your preset time before washing, but when it is washing, the digital timer shows the rest washing time. Pressing water level/spin button, you can select appropriate level. If you need to add water during washing, you can press water level/spin button and un-press will stop adding. 🎽【Compact Design with Large Load Capacity & Easy to Carry】This apartment washer is light and compact for saving your space, what’s more its lightweight makes it very easily to move from one place to another. It is an ideal choice for families, camping trips, RVs, boats, dormitories and apartments. The honeycomb shaped inner tub can load about 17.6 lbs at one time and wash a lot of clothes for you. In user manual, we also listed reference weight of various clothes. 🎽【Automatic Imbalance Adjustment】 This full automatic washing machine equipped with Auto Unbalance Detection (AUD), therefore it's able to automatically fix the unbalance issue. If the laundries inside the tub are not put equally, it would cause violent vibration. At this time, Our RV clothes washer can easily avoid violent shaking.Our washer and dryer combo not only can be used to wash your clothes but also for drying them. And washing and dehydration can be used separately. 🎽 【High cost-effective accessories and sincere service】 Provide you with fast delivery service from the US warehouse.This portable washing machine with drain pump meets North American electrical standards and contains cost-effective accessories-the faucet adapter is included, which saves you a lot of money and solves the problem of faucet installation .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71blCUsYLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B098QLRN4C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098QLRN4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B098QLRN4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
