window.products.push({"id":93811,"name":"OKADA Portable Ice Maker Countertop - 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins - Makes 26 lbs Ice in 24 hrs - Electric Ice Making Machine with Basket and Ice Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VGJx8XYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUIET & QUICKLY MAKE ICE IN 6 MINUTES - The ice making machine can produce up to 26 pounds of ice in 24 hrs. Within 6 to 13 minutes, you will begin to see the first batch of 9 bullet-shape ice cubes. You wont need an ice tray again. The ice maker stores up to 2 pounds of ice at a time in its insulated storage bin. Running at only 38 decibels, you can enjoy fresh ice cubes without bearing harsh noises. TWO TYPES OF CLEANING METHODS - This portable ice maker features a built-in self-cleaning function for an easy daily clean. Just press and hold the ON/OFF button for 5 seconds to start the cleaning mode. The fully-open design lid allows the machine and you to clean the machine thoroughly. Regular cleaning helps mantain the ice maker for longer lasting use and it will keep your ice cubes clear of unwanted cloudyness. COMPACT & PORTABLE ICE MAKER - With dimensions of 9.5 x 13.9 x 13in, this countertop ice maker unit is small enough to move on and off the counter. It is compact, portable and will work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it into. No water or drain lines are needed making it a useful addition for boats, kitchens, restraunts, bars, office, and more. SMART INDICATOR & TWO ICE SIZE OPTIONS - The ice maker indicator light automatically lights up when the ice basket is full. The machine will automatically stop producing ice when it is full and will stop when water needs to be added to the machine. Meanwhile, you can select small or large ice cubes depending on your preference. The bullet-shaped ice cubes have a hollow middle which generates a flow of liquids through the center, cooling the drinks quicker. Great for parties and events. ADVANCED CUSTOMER SERVICE - A removable basket and ice scoop are included for easy serving. Our Countertop Portable Ice Maker is covered with a one year worry free warranty. Its made from food-grade materials to provide you with healthy and safe ice cubes. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about our countertop ice maker. Our technical advice and local customer service are provided for your convience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VGJx8XYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud Mountain","source_asin":"B08BHHLQ75","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-93811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHHLQ75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHHLQ75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
